{"date":"2010-11-20","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/64/bb/28020_kKKcF.jpg"},"summary":"　　在古欧洲的农庄里，被女巫雅加婆婆使役的鸡蛋公主整日过著奴仆般的生活。某一天鸡蛋公主拍打的酵母突然意外地拥有着生命，之后鸡蛋公主与酵母君打算俩人一同偷偷逃开， 远离被雅加婆婆操控的日子。\r\n　　剧情为宫崎骏从16世纪画家老彼得·布吕赫尔的画作“收割者”（The Harvesters）所获取的灵感。\r\n　　而宫崎骏也注意到：就像日本童话“老鼠与饭团”（おむすびころりん）故事中乱滚动到老鼠洞底下饭团的情节、西方也有面包自行逃跑类似的童话故事，于是便想创作一个关于面包种逃亡的动画。","name":"パン種とタマゴ姫","name_cn":"酵母君与鸡蛋公主","tags":[{"name":"宫崎骏","count":51,"total_count":38543},{"name":"短片","count":44,"total_count":101170},{"name":"吉卜力","count":43,"total_count":42609},{"name":"2010","count":30,"total_count":43161},{"name":"剧场版","count":21,"total_count":715715},{"name":"原创","count":11,"total_count":610524},{"name":"久石让","count":10,"total_count":14423},{"name":"宮崎駿","count":8,"total_count":10762},{"name":"酵母君与鸡蛋公主","count":7,"total_count":7},{"name":"GHIBLI","count":4,"total_count":1478},{"name":"日本","count":3,"total_count":285794},{"name":"日本动画","count":3,"total_count":34641},{"name":"高坂希太郎","count":3,"total_count":555},{"name":"スタジオジブリ","count":2,"total_count":501},{"name":"独立剧场版","count":2,"total_count":963},{"name":"萌","count":2,"total_count":70769},{"name":"田中敦子","count":1,"total_count":197},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_count":35229},{"name":"其它","count":1,"total_count":917},{"name":"2010年","count":1,"total_count":2379},{"name":"Short_film","count":1,"total_count":431},{"name":"新世纪OVA及剧场","count":1,"total_count":308},{"name":"2010s","count":1,"total_count":5578},{"name":"子供向","count":1,"total_count":12456},{"name":"其他","count":1,"total_count":2904},{"name":"作画アニメ","count":1,"total_count":61},{"name":"巨乳","count":1,"total_count":32530},{"name":"无台词","count":1,"total_count":19},{"name":"短篇","count":1,"total